      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please also document it. Drove myself and a few others crazy trying to figure out how to do a simple thing I see in many worlds only to finally find advice in a foreign language explaining that we need to break into the Avatar SDK to get the necessary Behavior component to configure a Station.",
