  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-20T08:38:29.883Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the situation of making station attached custom animation, we need VRCAnimatorTrackingControl script, but it's only for SDK-Avatar.\nPast, we were importing SDK-Avatar with Careful not to interfere to SDK-World.\nNow, VCC denied import SDK-World and Avatar to same project. It's time to add proper procedures.",
